Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.45,0:21:32.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Иә
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.16,0:21:37.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Уф
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.45,0:21:39.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Қарғыс атқыр...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.21,0:21:43.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Уф...
